<title>POLAND: Polish stocks close lower in live trade.</title>
<headline>Polish stocks close lower in live trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in BRE, Budimex and Stalexport fell and Rolimpex and Universal were flat in the Warsaw bourse's continuous trading system on Friday.</p>
<p>Share turnover fell to 0.4 million zlotys from Thursday's 0.9 million.</p>
<p>Mass privatisation NFI units fell to 142 zlotys in a 30.5-million zloty trade.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
